## 🧠 About The Project

A handwritten digit recognition web application powered by **Convolutional Neural Networks (CNN)**, TensorFlow and Streamlit.

Draw any digit from **0 to 9** on the interactive canvas. The trained deep learning model analyzes the drawing and predicts the digit along with its confidence score.

## 🌟 Features

- ✍️ Interactive drawing canvas
- ⚡ Real-time digit prediction
- 🎯 Prediction confidence scores
- 📊 Probability visualization for all 10 digits
- 🖼️ Processed image preview
- 🌐 Interactive web application

## 🏆 Model Performance

| Metric | Details |
|---|---|
| Dataset | MNIST |
| Training Images | 60,000 |
| Testing Images | 10,000 |
| Image Dimensions | 28 × 28 pixels |
| Model | Convolutional Neural Network |
| Test Accuracy | **99.1%** |

<sub>Accuracy measured on the MNIST test dataset.</sub>

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

| Technology | Purpose |
|---|---|
| Python | Programming |
